  "description": "GUID Version 7 (RFC 9562) ID generation extension for FS.EntityFramework.Library providing timestamp-based sequential GUIDs with zero external dependencies. Perfect for .NET 9+ applications requiring RFC-compliant, chronologically ordered unique identifiers.",
